```js
const fib = (n) => {
  if (n === 0 || n === 1) return n;

  return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2);
};
```

- Time: O(2^n)
- Space: O(n)



#### memoized (pass)

```js
const fib = (n, memo = {}) => {
  if (n === 0 || n === 1) return n;

  if (n in memo) return memo[n];

  memo[n] = fib(n - 1, memo) + fib(n - 2, memo);
  return memo[n];
};
```

- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

