## solutions



#### brute-force (timeout)

```cpp
int fib(int n) {
  if (n < 2) {
    return n;
  }
  return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2);
}
```

- Time: O(2^n)
- Space: O(n)



#### memoized (pass)

```cpp
#include <unordered_map>

int fib(int n, std::unordered_map<int,int> &memo) {
  if (memo.count(n) > 0) {
    return memo[n];
  }

  if (n < 2) {
    return n;
  }

  memo[n] = fib(n - 1, memo) + fib(n - 2, memo);
  return memo[n];
}

int fib(int n) {
  std::unordered_map<int,int> memo;
  return fib(n, memo);
}
```

- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
